    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEAPORT MAN is a short horror game where the protagonist, having escaped from a sunken ship, drifts across the vast ocean.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ship I was on for work sank due to an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrift in a lifeboat, I wandered the endless sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as I was reaching my limit, I spotted the shadow of an island in the distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With my last ounce of strength, I set my sights on reaching it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person 3D short horror game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style visual effects (can be turned off in settings)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be completed in about 30 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed solo by a 16-year-old.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Video Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and companies can upload and stream videos of the game without permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include a link to the Steam page in the video description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAYBIS GAMES is not responsible for any damages resulting from uploading or streaming gameplay videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This guideline is subject to change without prior notice.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEAPORT MAN is a short horror game where the protagonist, having escaped from a sunken ship, drifts across the vast ocean.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ship I was on for work sank due to an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrift in a lifeboat, I wandered the endless sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as I was reaching my limit, I spotted the shadow of an island in the distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With my last ounce of strength, I set my sights on reaching it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person 3D short horror game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style visual effects (can be turned off in settings)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be completed in about 30 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed solo by a 16-year-old.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Video Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and companies can upload and stream videos of the game without permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include a link to the Steam page in the video description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAYBIS GAMES is not responsible for any damages resulting from uploading or streaming gameplay videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This guideline is subject to change without prior notice.</p>",
